@startuml
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam participantpadding 10
skinparam boxpadding 10

participant "Frontend" as Client
participant "Backend (Core)" as Core
participant "Auth (SSO)" as Auth
participant "DocStorage" as Storage
participant "Database" as DB

title Последовательность сессии (Stateless Model)

== 1. Авторизация ==
Client -> Core: POST /v1/auth/refresh (refresh_token)
Core -> Auth: Validate Refresh Token
alt
    Auth --> Core: 401 Unauthorized
    Core --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
else [. Happy Path]
    Auth --> Core: New Access Token (JWT, 15 min)
    Core --> Client: 200 OK (Access Token)
 end

== 2. Получение начального состояния ==
Client -> Core: GET /v1/collections (Auth: Bearer JWT)
Core -> DB: SELECT * FROM collections WHERE user_id=...
DB --> Core: [Collection 1, Collection 2]
Core --> Client: 200 OK (Snapshot)

== 3. Загрузка файла ==

Client -> Core: POST /v1/documents/doc1/files (Idempotency-Key: KEY-123, File)
Core -> Core: Validate request (e.g., file size > 50MB?)
alt [Ошибка 400 Bad Request]
    Core --> Client: 400 Bad Request (File too large)
end

Core -> DB: Check Idempotency-Key (KEY-123) & Permissions
alt [Ошибка 500 (Сбой Хранилища)]
    DB --> Core: OK to proceed
    Core -> Storage: Upload file (stream)
    Storage --> Core: 500 Server Error (e.g., S3 timeout)
    Core -> Core: (Log error)
    Core --> Client: 500 Internal Server Error (trace_id)
else [. Happy Path]
    DB --> Core: OK to proceed
    Core -> Storage: Upload file (stream)
    Storage --> Core: 201 + doc_storage_id
    Core -> DB: insert file record (doc_storage_id, status=UPLOADED)
    DB --> Core: file_id
    Core -> DB: save idempotency record (KEY-123 -> file_id)
    Core --> Client: 201 Created {file_id, doc_storage_id}
end

@enduml